review/verify.text:
{{- if and .VerifyCommand .MergeGate }}
- Do not re-run the full verify command ({{ .VerifyCommand }}). The implementing session
  ran it before committing, and the merge waits on `{{ .MergeGate }}`, which
  refuses a head that is not green. Build, and run the tests of only the
  packages or modules this diff touches, in the foreground, never in the
  background: a process left running when your session exits parks the pass.
  Grading `verified` rests on tracing each requirement to code, which no test
  run does for you.
{{- else if .VerifyCommand }}
- Re-run the verify command yourself: {{ .VerifyCommand }}
  In the foreground, never in the background: a process left running when
  your session exits parks the pass.
{{- end }}
